Package: pempi
Type: Package
Title: Proportion Estimation with Marginal Proxy Information
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-05-15
LazyData: true
Authors@R: c(
    person("Stéphane", "Guerrier", email = "stef.guerrier@gmail.com", role = c("aut","cre")),
    person("Maria-Pia", "Victoria-Feser", role = c("aut")),
    person("Christoph", "Kuzmics", role = c("aut"))
    )
Maintainer: Stéphane Guerrier <stef.guerrier@gmail.com>
Description: Tools for the conditional estimation of the prevalence of an
    emerging or rare infectious disease, combining a survey sample with
    population-level case-count data and accounting for measurement error.
    Implements the methods proposed in Guerrier, Kuzmics and Victoria-Feser
    (2024) <doi:10.1080/01621459.2024.2313790>. The companion paper received
    the 2024 JASA Reproducibility Award.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
