RoxygenNote: 7.2.3
Encoding: UTF-8
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/stephaneguerrier/pempi, https://stephaneguerrier.github.io/pempi/
